      "level": 1,
      "topic": "travel",
      "title_zh": "坐车回家",
      "title_en": "Going home",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["这", "个", "月", "，", "我", "坐", "车", "回家", "看", "妈妈", "。"],
        ["我", "的", "东西", "很", "多", "，", "也", "很", "重", "。", "我", "一", "个", "人", "拿", "不", "了", "。"],
        ["站", "里", "人", "非常", "多", "。", "车", "来", "晚", "了", "，", "我", "等", "了", "两", "个", "小时", "。"],
        ["一", "个", "男人", "帮", "我", "拿", "东西", "。", "我", "说", "：", "“", "谢谢", "！", "”"],
        ["晚上", "十", "点", "，", "我", "到", "家", "了", "。", "妈妈", "笑", "着", "说", "：", "“", "你", "回来", "了", "！", "”", "我们", "一起", "吃", "了", "点", "东西", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This month I took the train home to see Mum.",
        "I had lots of things with me, and they were heavy. I couldn’t carry them on my own.",
        "The station was really crowded. The train was late, and I waited two hours.",
        "A man helped me carry my things. I said: “Thank you!”",
        "At ten in the evening I got home. Mum smiled and said: “You’re back!” We had a bite to eat together."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["回家", "重", "晚"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "回家", "english": "to go home" },
        { "word": "重", "english": "heavy" },
        { "word": "晚", "english": "late" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-06-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "我的书在哪？",
      "title_en": "Where's my book?",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "的", "书", "在", "哪", "？", "我", "找", "了", "很", "多", "地方", "。", "今天", "我", "还", "要", "用", "呢", "！"],
        ["我", "问", "妈妈", "：", "“", "你", "看到", "我", "的", "书", "了", "吗", "？", "”", "妈妈", "说", "：", "“", "没有", "。", "”"],
        ["我", "再", "找", "了", "一", "次", "，", "还是", "没有", "找到", "。"],
        ["最后", "，", "我", "看到", "了", "：", "书", "就", "在", "我", "手", "里", "！", "我", "正", "拿", "着", "呢", "。"],
        ["妈妈", "问", "：", "“", "真的", "吗", "？", "”", "我们", "都", "笑", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Where’s my book? I’ve looked in lots of places. I need it today!",
        "I asked Mum: “Have you seen my book?” Mum said: “No.”",
        "I looked once more, but still didn't find it.",
        "In the end I saw it: the book was in my hand! I was holding it the whole time.",
        "Mum asked: “Really?” We both laughed."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["书", "哪", "真的"],
      "glossary": [
